<title>INDIA: India's UTI Money market fund NAV 10.1450 rupees.</title>
<headline>India's UTI Money market fund NAV 10.1450 rupees.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-run mutual fund Unit Trust of India (UTI) said on Thursday the net asset value of its money market mutual fund was 10.1450 rupees on June 18:</p>
<p>This NAV implies a daily compounded annualised growth rate of 9.90 percent per annum from the date of launch of scheme (April 23, 1997) till Wednesday, while the growth in last 30 days of the scheme (since 19 June 1997) was 10.42 percent, it said.</p>
</text>
